    ^{:tag ^{:go/pos {:name-pos [728 21]}} bool :doc "InsecureSkipVerify controls whether a client verifies the server's\ncertificate chain and host name. If InsecureSkipVerify is true, crypto/tls\naccepts any certificate presented by the server and any host name in that\ncertificate. In this mode, TLS is susceptible to machine-in-the-middle\nattacks unless custom verification is used. This should be used only for\ntesting or in combination with VerifyConnection or VerifyPeerCertificate.\n" :go/pos {:name-pos [728 2]}} InsecureSkipVerify






